---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Mast from './Mast.astro';
import { t, localePath, otherLocale, type Locale } from '../lib/i18n';

interface Props {
  locale: Locale;
}

const { locale } = Astro.props;
---
<Base
  title={t(locale, 'page.aboutTitle')}
  description={t(locale, 'page.aboutDesc')}
  nav="about"
  locale={locale}
  switchHref={localePath(otherLocale(locale), '/about')}
>
  <Mast locale={locale} compact />

  {locale === 'zh' ? (
    <article class="about">
      <section class="about-block">
        <h2>这是什么</h2>
        <p>这是非官方、编辑向的 Grok Bot 玩法导航，不是 prompt 货架，也不卖模板。</p>
      </section>

      <section class="about-block">
        <h2>收录</h2>
        <p>每条必须有可点开的真实来源：公开帖或官方说明。没有来源的不写。现刊 33 条，收在 content/plays.json。</p>
      </section>

      <section class="about-block">
        <h2>数字</h2>
        <p>不编造点赞、阅读或后台统计。卡片上不会出现这些数字。</p>
      </section>

      <section class="about-block">
        <h2>关系</h2>
        <p>本站与 xAI / Grok 无关。</p>
      </section>
    </article>
  ) : (
    <article class="about">
      <section class="about-block">
        <h2>What this is</h2>
        <p>An unofficial, edited catalog of Grok Bot plays. Not a prompt shop. Nothing for sale.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="about-block">
        <h2>What’s here</h2>
        <p>Every play needs a real, clickable source — a public post or official docs. No source, no entry. English plays are not up yet. The Chinese catalog has 33.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="about-block">
        <h2>Numbers</h2>
        <p>We don’t invent likes, views, or dashboard stats. Cards don’t show those.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="about-block">
        <h2>Affiliation</h2>
        <p>This site is not affiliated with xAI or Grok.</p>
      </section>
    </article>
  )}
</Base>
